name pecha
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Print Tibetan text in the classic pecha layout style
relocated 1
longdesc The pecha class provides an environment for writing Tibetan on
longdesc LaTeX2e in the traditional Tibetan Pecha layout used for
longdesc spiritual or philosophical texts, using the cTib4TeX package by
longdesc Oliver Corff. It provides features like headers in different
longdesc languages, page numbering in Tibetan and more.
runfiles size=11
